# @NAME@

cFE library following the local `libs/sample_lib` layout. Its public interface is
`fsw/public_inc/@NAME@.h`; implementation and private headers are in `fsw/src`.

`@PREFIX@_Init` runs from the native `CFE_LIB` startup entry. A library has no
application task and receives no scheduler entries. Calling apps declare
`add_cfe_app_dependency(app_name @NAME@)` in their CMake configuration.

These files are created once and remain editable; app generation preserves them.
